{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-005","topic":"design_freedom_boundary","value":{"design_system_count":1,"presentation_vocabulary":"CONTROLLED","model_may_select":["legal_component","information_hierarchy","density","emphasis","image_weight","bounded_presentation_profile"],"model_may_not_emit":["HTML","CSS","color","coordinate"],"free_form_style_generation":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-1-q3-adjustment-1","captured_text":"不定义为‘一套固定视觉语言’，而定义为‘一套固定 Design System + 受控 Presentation Vocabulary’。模型仍不得生成 HTML/CSS/颜色/坐标，但允许在合法组件、信息层级、密度、强调方式、图片权重和少量 presentation profile 中做受控选择，避免退化成单纯填模板。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T14:40:31+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-006","topic":"runtime_render_observation_loop","value":{"renderer":"DETERMINISTIC","browser_dom_screenshot_observer":"RUNTIME_REQUIRED","agent_uses_real_render_evidence":true,"repair_target":"presentation_defects"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-1-q3-adjustment-2","captured_text":"V1.2 将 Browser/DOM Screenshot Observer 正式纳入运行时闭环，而不仅作为人工评审证据。Renderer 保持 deterministic，Agent 根据真实渲染结果识别 presentation defects 并进行 bounded patch。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T14:40:31+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-007","topic":"run_wide_revision_budget","value":{"revision_attempts_max":2,"semantic_patch_attempts_max":1,"presentation_patch_attempts_max":2,"routing":"BY_DEFECT_TYPE","unbounded_optimization":false,"budget_exhaustion_outcomes":["COMPLETE","DEGRADED","FAILED"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-1-revision-budget","captured_text":"返工预算改为总计最多 2 次，由 defect type 路由；Semantic Patch 最多 1 次，但允许两次都用于 Presentation Patch。预算耗尽后进入 COMPLETE / DEGRADED / FAILED，不进行无限优化。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T14:40:31+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-008","topic":"minimal_claim_graph_authority","value":{"claim_kinds":["STATED","SOURCE_SUPPORTED_SYNTHESIS"],"all_final_conclusions_trace_to":"Canonical_Transcript","external_knowledge":false,"complex_claim_relationship_taxonomy":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-2-q4","captured_text":"Q4：允许 `STATED` 和有明确来源支持的综合结论，但不要继续扩展复杂 Claim relationship taxonomy。核心要求只是所有最终结论都能追溯到 Canonical Transcript，不引入外部知识。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:08:56+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-009","topic":"editorial_and_presentation_authority","value":{"editorial_owns":["what_the_report_says","final_semantic_content"],"presentation_owns":["how_content_is_presented"],"presentation_may_rewrite_core_content":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-2-q5","captured_text":"Q5：按推荐。Editorial 决定讲什么和最终语义内容，Presentation 只决定怎么呈现，不得改写核心内容。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:08:56+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-010","topic":"minimal_revision_mechanism","value":{"total_patch_budget_max":2,"technical_failure_retry":"FINITE","standalone_revision_accounting_object":false,"implementation_internal_counter_if_necessary":true},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-2-q6","captured_text":"Q6：保留有限返工和明确终止即可。总 Patch Budget 最多 2 次，技术失败有限重试；终态暂按 COMPLETE / DEGRADED / FAILED 的语义继续设计，但不要引入额外的 revision accounting 对象，除非实现阶段确实需要。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:08:56+08:00"}}
