{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-012","topic":"pre_freeze_architecture_ablation","value":{"required_before":"V1.2_SPEC_FREEZE","keep_only_if_directly_serves":["report_quality","source_trust","finite_self_repair_loop"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-2-ablation","captured_text":"Grilling 完成后，在冻结 V1.2 Spec 之前统一做一次架构消融，删除没有直接服务于报告质量、来源可信和有限自修复闭环的机制。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:08:56+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-013","topic":"fixed_stage_single_model_harness","value":{"model_count":1,"orchestration":"HARNESS_FIXED_STAGES","free_react_loop":false,"free_browser_tool_loop":false,"stage_input":"EXPLICIT_ARTIFACT_SNAPSHOT","implicit_chat_memory":false,"roles_are_mandatory_first_class_states":false,"roles_may_be_ablated":true},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-3-q7","captured_text":"采用 Harness 固定阶段编排，同一个模型分阶段调用，不采用 Coding Agent 式自由 ReAct/browser/tool loop。模型不能自行增加步骤或决定无限继续。保留显式 Artifact Snapshot，使每个阶段基于明确输入工作，不依赖隐式聊天记忆。但当前列出的 Claim Builder、Critic、Reviser 等先视为执行流程中的角色/调用，不全部固化成长期的一等架构状态。产品级流程保持较粗粒度，后续消融可以删除收益不足的独立 Critic/Reviser 调用，而不需要改变整体架构。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:29:43+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-014","topic":"visual_asset_consumption_boundary","value":{"visual_asset_set":"OPTIONAL_LOCAL_SUPPLIED_INPUT","presentation_may_choose":["use","binding","visual_weight"],"asset_discovery":false,"automatic_frame_extraction":false,"full_video_visual_understanding":false,"vlm_search":false,"image_generation":false,"empty_asset_text_report_complete":true},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-3-q8","captured_text":"V1.2 可以消费可选的本地 Visual Asset Set，并由 Presentation Plan 决定是否使用、绑定到哪里以及视觉权重。边界明确为：V1.2 可以‘使用图片’，但不负责‘发现图片’。自动抽帧、全视频视觉理解、VLM 搜索和图片生成均不属于 V1.2。没有资产时纯文本报告必须完整工作。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:29:43+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-015","topic":"minimal_browser_observer_boundary","value":{"observer":"NARROW_DETERMINISTIC_LOCAL_PAGE_SENSOR","visual_critic":"MODEL_ROLE","model_direct_browser_control":false,"free_navigation":false,"dom_mutation":false,"minimum_observation":["rendered_screenshot","basic_page_and_element_geometry","overflow","clipping"],"complex_sensor_taxonomy":false,"browser_control_framework":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-3-q9","captured_text":"Browser Observer 是窄而 deterministic 的真实页面 sensor，Visual Critic 才是模型角色。模型不直接控制浏览器、不自由导航或修改 DOM。Observer 第一版保持最小能力，只采集足够支持视觉评审的信息，例如真实渲染截图、基础页面/元素几何、overflow/clipping 等明显 DOM 异常。不要提前扩展复杂 sensor、视觉 taxonomy 或 browser-control framework。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:29:43+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-016","topic":"viewport_gate_authority","value":{"hard_gate_viewports":"DERIVED_FROM_EXPLICITLY_SUPPORTED_PRODUCT_SURFACES","future_possible_mobile_support_is_not_sufficient":true},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-3-q9-viewports","captured_text":"桌面和移动视口是否都作为 Hard Gate，由 V1.2 最终明确承诺的产品展示面决定；不要仅因未来可能支持移动端而增加强制质量门。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:29:43+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-017","topic":"supported_report_surface","value":{"canonical_report":"FIXED_WIDTH_DESKTOP","design_viewport_px":1080,"browser_observation_quality_object":true,"mobile":"BEST_EFFORT_NOT_COMPLETE_GATE","mobile_runtime_observation_required":false,"web_shell":"RUN_STATUS_AND_OPEN_ONLY","web_shell_visual_quality_scope":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-4-q10","captured_text":"V1.2 正式只承诺固定宽度的桌面 Canonical Report，并以当前 1080px 设计面作为 Browser Observation 的正式质量对象。移动端保持 best-effort，不参与 COMPLETE 判定；开发评估时可以额外截图，但不是运行时必需证据。Web Shell 只承担运行入口、状态展示和打开报告，不进入 V1.2 的视觉质量目标。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:59:15+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-018","topic":"fixed_editorial_objective_and_no_brief","value":{"editorial_brief":false,"user_custom_audience":false,"user_custom_reading_goal":false,"user_custom_depth":false,"user_custom_style":false,"interactive_pre_generation_questions":false,"objective":"让未观看原视频的读者能够独立理解视频的主要结论、论证脉络、关键依据和重要限制。","agent_selects_focus_and_organization":true,"v1_3_candidate":"OPTIONAL_FREE_TEXT_EDITORIAL_INSTRUCTION"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-4-q11","captured_text":"V1.2 删除 Editorial Brief，不提供用户自定义受众、阅读目标、内容深度或风格的输入。V1.2 只采用一个版本化的固定默认 Editorial Objective：让未观看原视频的读者能够独立理解视频的主要结论、论证脉络、关键依据和重要限制。Agent 根据视频内容自行完成重点选择和报告组织，不在生成前向用户请求额外 Brief，也不提供内容风格定制。Editorial Brief / audience / depth customization 作为后续产品能力推迟到 V1.3作为candidate：optional free-text Editorial Instruction","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:59:15+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-019","topic":"source_uncertainty_behavior","value":{"source_state":"REUSE_V1.1","new_confidence_system":false,"new_uncertainty_taxonomy":false,"nonessential_uncertainty":"OMIT_FIRST","essential_safe_summary":"CAUTIOUS_WORDING_WITH_BRIEF_NOTICE_WHEN_NEEDED","unresolved_evidence_may_independently_support_key_conclusion":false,"core_conclusion_unreliable":"FAILED","credible_report_with_nonblocking_local_omission":"DEGRADED","semantic_patch_may_modify_guess_or_correct_canonical_transcript":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-4-q12","captured_text":"不确定且非关键的信息优先省略；关键但仍可安全概括的信息使用保守措辞，必要时给出简短的不确定提示；UNRESOLVED evidence 不得独立承担关键 reader-facing conclusion；如果来源不确定性已经使核心结论无法可靠成立，则 FAILED；Semantic Patch 永远不得修改、猜测或‘纠正’ Canonical Transcript。如果主体报告仍然来源可信，仅存在由局部不确定性导致的非阻断缺失，可以 DEGRADED。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T15:59:15+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-020","topic":"complete_context_input_envelope","value":{"canonical_transcript_unicode_characters_max":50000,"complete_context_required":true,"oversize":"INPUT_TOO_LARGE","truncate":false,"hidden_chunking":false,"partial_claim_graph":false,"claim_merge":false,"future_chunking_trigger":"REAL_DEMAND"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-5-q13","captured_text":"V1.2 只支持能够完整进入当前语义处理上下文的 Canonical Transcript，继续复用现有 50,000 Unicode 字符上限。超限直接 `INPUT_TOO_LARGE`，不截断、不隐藏 chunking、不做局部 Claim merge。长 Transcript 分块与跨块合并推迟到真实需求出现后再设计。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:19:49+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-021","topic":"adaptive_report_body_structure","value":{"report_shell":["Hero_and_core_overview","ordered_body","Sources","Limitations"],"editorial_controls":["chapter_count","chapter_responsibility","depth","content_density"],"presentation_selects_legal_components":true,"fixed_component_quotas":false,"mandatory_component_families":false,"deterministic_safety_ceilings":true,"complex_claim_to_budget_algorithm":false,"exact_limits":"IMPLEMENTATION_EVALUATION_AND_ABLATION"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-5-q14","captured_text":"采用‘固定报告外壳 + 内容自适应正文结构’。固定只保留 Hero / 核心概述、顺序正文区域以及 Sources / Limitations 等稳定报告外壳。Editorial 根据内容自行决定章节数量、章节职责、展开程度和内容密度；Presentation 根据内容选择合法组件，不再要求固定组件配额，也不要求每份报告必须出现 metric / comparison / process / takeaway 等组件。仍保留少量确定性的安全上限以避免报告失控，但暂不设计复杂的 Claim 数量 → 动态预算算法。具体长度和组件上限在实现评估与消融时确定。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:19:49+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-022","topic":"multimodal_model_input_and_productization_boundary","value":{"configured_multimodal_model_may_read":["supplied_visual_assets","renderer_report_screenshot"],"new_rights_taxonomy":false,"asset_permission_system":false,"special_local_external_dual_path":false,"external_provider_disclosure":["text_may_be_sent","images_may_be_sent","report_screenshots_may_be_sent"],"full_privacy_copyright_online_policy":"PRODUCT_RELEASE_PHASE","v1_2_target":"LOCAL","hosted_service_and_public_url_ingest":"V1.3_PRODUCTIZATION_EVALUATION"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-5-q15","captured_text":"V1.2 正常允许配置的多模态模型读取：已提供的 Visual Asset；本次 Renderer 生成的报告截图。这属于正常的模型输入能力，不新增 rights taxonomy、asset permission system 或特殊本地/外部双轨逻辑。如果配置的是外部模型 Provider，产品层后续只需要明确告知用户相关文本、图片或报告截图可能发送给该 Provider。更完整的隐私、版权和线上服务政策属于产品发布阶段处理，不进入当前报告生成 Harness 的核心架构。当前目标仍是先完成本地 V1.2；未来是否作为线上服务发布以及 Bilibili URL ingest 的公开服务边界，在 V1.3 产品化阶段单独评估。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:19:49+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-023","topic":"current_framework_strategy","value":{"harness":"PROJECT_OWNED_PYTHON_PYDANTIC","langgraph":false,"hypha":false,"mcp_workflow":false,"general_multi_agent_runtime":false,"boundary":"TYPED_ARTIFACT_TO_STAGE_TO_ARTIFACT","future_framework_migration":"ALLOWED_WHEN_REAL_COMPLEXITY_REQUIRES","frameworkless_permanent_principle":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-6-q16","captured_text":"V1.2 继续采用 project-owned Python/Pydantic Harness，不引入 LangGraph、Hypha、MCP workflow 或通用 multi-agent runtime。但保持各阶段为清晰的 typed Artifact → Stage → Artifact 边界，使未来如果真实出现动态分支、checkpoint/resume、human-in-the-loop、多 Agent 或复杂工具生态，可以低成本迁移到 LangGraph 等 orchestration framework。V1.2 不为框架而引框架，也不把 frameworkless 定义为永久产品原则。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:43:38+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-024","topic":"presentation_profile_deferred","value":{"named_presentation_profiles_in_v1_2":false,"presentation_plan_selects":["legal_component","information_density","hierarchy","emphasis","image_weight","spatial_grouping"],"future_profile_trigger":"EVALUATION_SHOWS_REPEATED_VALUABLE_STRATEGY_COMBINATIONS"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","overrides_fields":["DEC-VR12-005.presentation_profile"],"evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-6-q17","captured_text":"V1.2 暂不引入命名的 Presentation Profile。保留一个统一 Design System，由 Presentation Plan 根据内容自行决定合法组件、信息密度、层级、强调方式、图片权重和空间分组。暂不预先抽象 Narrative / Evidence-dense 两类 Profile。只有后续 eval 证明报告稳定出现若干重复且有价值的视觉策略组合时，再将这些组合抽象为 Profile。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:43:38+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-025","topic":"visual_to_semantic_escalation","value":{"visual_critic_semantic_write_authority":false,"visual_critic_may_recommend_defect_layer":true,"default_patch":"PRESENTATION","semantic_escalation_conditions":["content_length_root_cause","content_selection_root_cause","editorial_redundancy_root_cause","other_editorial_root_cause_not_reasonably_fixable_by_presentation"],"controller_authorizes_escalation":true,"semantic_patch_uses_remaining_global_budget":true,"semantic_patch_max":1,"old_presentation_plan_after_semantic_patch":"INVALID","required_rebuild":["Presentation_Plan","render","Browser_Observation"],"global_patch_budget_max":2,"open_cross_layer_loop":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-6-q18","captured_text":"Visual Critic 不拥有 Semantic 修改权限，但允许在 Presentation 无法解决根因时向 Controller 请求一次 Semantic escalation。默认优先使用 Presentation Patch。只有当缺陷根因属于内容长度、内容取舍、表达冗余或其他 Editorial 问题，并且在 Presentation 权限内无法合理修复时，Controller 才允许使用剩余 Revision Budget 执行 Semantic Patch。Semantic Patch 生效后，旧 Presentation Plan 自动失效，必须重新生成、渲染和观察。Visual Critic 本身只能报告问题与建议的 defect layer，不能直接修改 Editorial 内容。仍受总 Patch Budget 最多 2 次、Semantic Patch 最多 1 次的约束，因此不会形成开放式跨层循环。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T16:43:38+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-026","topic":"parallel_versioned_v1_2_runtime_path","value":{"versioned_v1_2_ownership":["schemas","harness_orchestrator","run_bundle","run_identity"],"shared_with_existing_product":["Canonical_Transcript","ingest","Web_CLI_infrastructure","reusable_renderer_design_primitives"],"duplicate_full_product":false,"mutate_historical_v0_v1a_contracts":false,"mutate_frozen_evidence":false,"automatic_fallback_between_v1_2_and_legacy":false,"default_path_promotion_requires":["same_source_comparison","repeated_run_evaluation","separate_Owner_acceptance"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-7-q19","captured_text":"V1.2 建立并行、版本化的运行路径，不原地改写历史 V0/V1-A contract 和冻结证据。但‘并行’只针对 V1.2 的 Schema、Harness/orchestrator、Run Bundle 和运行身份；Canonical Transcript、ingest、Web/CLI 基础设施以及可以复用的 renderer/design primitives 继续共享，不复制维护两套完整产品代码。V1.2 与 legacy path 不自动 fallback。V1.2 经过同源比较、重复运行评估和 Owner 接受后，再单独决定是否切换为默认路径。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T17:16:42+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-027","topic":"v1_2_presentation_contract_independent_of_legacy_report_plan","value":{"legacy_ReportPlan_compatibility_contract":false,"legacy_seven_Typed_Blocks_compatibility_contract":false,"legacy_component_implementations":"CANDIDATE_PRESENTATION_VOCABULARY_PRIMITIVES","v1_2_may":["redefine_components","merge_components","remove_components","add_necessary_components"],"editorial_selects_visual_block_type":false,"presentation_selects_controlled_expression":true,"arbitrary_HTML_CSS":false,"coordinates":false,"general_page_DSL":false,"final_vocabulary_and_safety_ceilings":"IMPLEMENTATION_EVALUATION_AND_PRE_FREEZE_ABLATION"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-7-q20","captured_text":"旧 `ReportPlan` 和七类 Typed Blocks 不作为 V1.2 的兼容契约。旧组件实现可以作为 Presentation Vocabulary 的候选实现复用，但 V1.2 可以重新定义、合并、删除或新增必要组件。Editorial 不再选择视觉 Block 类型；Presentation Plan 独立决定受控的表达方式。仍禁止任意 HTML/CSS、坐标和通用页面 DSL。最终 Vocabulary 与安全上限留到实现评估和冻结 Spec 前的架构消融中收敛。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T17:16:42+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-028","topic":"typed_artifact_regeneration_revision_contract","value":{"one_revision_may_address":"RELATED_DEFECT_SET_IN_ONE_LAYER","patch_DSL":false,"complex_operation_taxonomy":false,"presentation_reviser_inputs":["current_Editorial_Plan","current_Presentation_Plan","related_Presentation_Defects"],"presentation_reviser_output":"REPLACEMENT_VALID_PRESENTATION_PLAN","presentation_post_validation":["schema","hard_constraints"],"semantic_revision_targets_required":["Claim_ids_or_Editorial_Content_Unit_ids"],"semantic_reviser_output":"REPLACEMENT_VALID_SEMANTIC_ARTIFACT","semantic_scope_guard":["deterministic_diff","validation_against_authorized_targets"],"revision_budget_cost_per_execution_attempt":1,"budget_cost_independent_of_defect_count":true,"mixed_semantic_presentation_revision":false,"technical_failure_retry":"FINITE_IDENTICAL_RETRY_SEPARATE_FROM_REVISION_BUDGET","canonical_terms":["Semantic_Revision","Presentation_Revision"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-7-q21","captured_text":"保留‘一次 Revision 可以处理同一层的一组相关 Defect’，但不要为 V1.2 建立独立 Patch DSL 或复杂 operation taxonomy。Presentation Revision：Visual Critic 可以一次报告多个相关 Presentation Defect；Presentation Reviser读取当前 Editorial Plan、当前 Presentation Plan 和 Defect 集合，直接生成一份新的合法 Presentation Plan。由于 Presentation 不拥有语义内容，不要求 field-level Patch operation。新 Plan 通过 Schema / hard constraint validation 后重新 Render + Observe。Semantic Revision：Critic 必须明确指出需要修改的 Claim / Editorial Content Unit。Semantic Reviser可以输出更新后的合法 Artifact，但 Controller 通过 deterministic diff / validation 确认修改范围没有越过被授权目标，避免整份语义漂移。一次 Semantic 或 Presentation Revision 消耗一个 Revision Budget，不按 Defect 数量计费。Semantic 与 Presentation 仍不能在同一次 Revision 中混合。技术失败继续使用有限 identical retry。优先采用‘模型重新生成 typed Artifact + deterministic validation/diff’，而不是设计一套新的 Patch operation language。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T17:16:42+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-029","topic":"minimal_terminal_outcomes_and_defect_blocking","value":{"defect_severity_values":["BLOCKING","NON_BLOCKING"],"additional_severity_taxonomy":false,"defect_requires_rule_defined_impact_on":["report_credibility","readability","legal_delivery"],"pure_aesthetic_opportunity_is_defect":false,"pure_aesthetic_opportunity_triggers_revision":false,"pure_aesthetic_opportunity_blocks_complete":false,"COMPLETE_requires":["all_mandatory_stages_successful","full_1080px_Browser_Observation","source_grounding_schema_authority_renderer_DOM_hard_gates_pass","no_unresolved_rule_defined_material_defect"],"DEGRADED_requires":["valid_source_grounded_readable_Candidate_Report","hard_gates_pass"],"DEGRADED_allows":["known_non_blocking_source_omission","known_non_blocking_presentation_defect_after_budget"],"FAILED_when":["INPUT_TOO_LARGE","no_valid_grounded_report","mandatory_renderer_or_observer_unavailable_after_technical_retry","unresolved_blocking_defect"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-8-q22","captured_text":"Q22、Q24 按推荐。Q22：终态与 Defect 严重度只保留最小的 blocking / non-blocking 区分，不建立额外 severity taxonomy。纯审美优化建议不属于 Defect，不触发 Revision，也不影响 COMPLETE。Defect 必须对应规则定义内、能够影响报告可信性、可读性或合法交付的问题。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T18:08:58+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-030","topic":"single_model_architecture","value":{"all_model_roles_share_one_run_configuration":["Claim","Editorial","Semantic_Critic","Semantic_Reviser","Presentation","Visual_Critic","Presentation_Reviser"],"reference_model":"GLM-5.3-Flash","role_differentiators":["Prompt","input_Artifact","output_Schema","necessary_call_parameters"],"run_configuration":["Provider","Model","API_Key"],"role_level_model_variables":false,"model_routing":false,"model_fallback":false,"client_boundary":"UNIFIED_MODEL_CLIENT_AND_PROVIDER_ADAPTER","stage_direct_provider_SDK_binding":false,"future_role_level_override_requires":"REAL_EVALUATION_EVIDENCE_OF_MATERIAL_ROLE_SPECIFIC_NEED"},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-8-q23-model-adjustment","captured_text":"V1.2 明确采用 single-model architecture。所有需要模型判断的角色——Claim、Editorial、Semantic Critic/Reviser、Presentation、Visual Critic/Reviser——均使用同一个运行级模型配置，当前 reference model 为 GLM-5.3-Flash。模型差异不作为 V1.2 的角色配置维度。不同角色只通过各自的 Prompt、输入 Artifact、输出 Schema 和必要的调用参数区分。运行配置只需要一个 Provider / Model / API Key，不为不同角色预设 semantic_model、presentation_model、visual_model 等独立模型变量，也不实现 model routing 或 fallback。代码层保持统一 ModelClient / Provider Adapter 边界，避免各阶段直接绑定具体 SDK。未来只有在真实评估证明某个角色明显需要不同模型时，再新增显式 role-level model override；不为假设性的未来需求提前设计多模型系统。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T18:08:58+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-031","topic":"design_baseline_calibration_ablation_and_final_spec_freeze","value":{"current_deliverable":"V1_2_DESIGN_BASELINE","current_deliverable_is_final_frozen_spec":false,"design_baseline_fixes":["product_boundaries","Artifact_ownership","source_trust_principles","bounded_revision","Renderer_Observer_boundaries","core_terminal_semantics"],"implementation_requires_separate_authorization":true,"post_authorization_step":"MINIMAL_VERTICAL_LOOP_AND_REAL_RUN_CALIBRATION","calibration_may_resolve":["Presentation_Vocabulary","safety_ceilings","other_explicitly_evidence_reserved_parameters"],"then":"UNIFIED_ARCHITECTURE_ABLATION","final_spec_freeze_authority":"OWNER","calibration_may_reopen_confirmed_core_semantics_or_authority_boundaries":false,"calibration_may":["converge_evidence_reserved_parameters","remove_ablatable_mechanisms"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-8-q24","captured_text":"Q24：按推荐。当前阶段交付物定义为 V1.2 Design Baseline，而不是 Final Frozen Spec。Design Baseline 固定已经确认的产品边界、Artifact ownership、来源可信原则、bounded revision、Renderer/Observer 边界和核心状态语义。随后另行授权实现最小纵向闭环，并通过真实运行校准 Presentation Vocabulary、安全上限和其他必须依赖运行证据的参数。校准后执行统一 Architecture Ablation，再由 Owner 冻结 Final V1.2 Spec。实现校准不得重新打开已经确认的核心语义与权限边界，只允许收敛明确保留给运行证据决定的参数和可消融机制。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T18:08:58+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-032","topic":"minimal_identical_retry_and_revision_consumption","value":{"identical_retry_max":1,"retry_only_when_complete_model_response_absent":true,"eligible_transient_failures":["transport_failure","timeout","429","5xx"],"complete_response_hidden_resampling":false,"complete_response_is_model_result_even_if_validation_fails":["JSON","Schema","grounding","authority","other_validation"],"revision_budget_consumed_at":"CONTROLLER_AUTHORIZATION_OF_REVISER","invalid_or_unauthorized_reviser_result_consumes_budget":true,"finer_retry_revision_failure_state_machine_in_design_baseline":false,"invalid_initial_mandatory_artifact":"FAILED","revision_failure_next_action_inputs":["current_blocking_defect","remaining_revision_budget"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-9-q25","captured_text":"只有在没有取得完整模型响应时，例如 transport failure、timeout、429/5xx 等瞬时技术异常，才允许最多一次 identical retry。一旦已经取得完整模型响应，无论其后是否通过 JSON/Schema/grounding/authority 等校验，都视为本次模型结果，不进行隐藏重抽样。Reviser 调用一旦被 Controller 授权即消耗一个 Revision Budget；Reviser 返回非法或越权结果同样消耗该预算。暂不继续设计更细的 retry / revision failure state machine。初始必需 Artifact 无法形成合法结果则 FAILED；Revision 失败后根据当前仍存在的 blocking defect 和剩余预算决定是否继续或结束。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T19:37:59+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-033","topic":"capability_requirements_without_fixed_model_call_topology","value":{"immutable_independent_role_call_topology":false,"required_capabilities":["explicit_semantic_validation_or_review","real_presentation_render_and_observe","visual_review_of_rendered_result","revalidation_after_revision","controller_owned_bounded_revision_and_termination"],"semantic_critic_must_be_independent_model_call":"CALIBRATION_AND_ABLATION_DECISION","critic_reviser_split":"CALIBRATION_AND_ABLATION_DECISION","revision_revalidation_required":true,"revision_revalidation_requires_independent_critic_call":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-9-q26","captured_text":"当前 Design Baseline 不把 Claim Builder、Semantic Critic、Visual Critic、Reviser 等全部固化成不可变的独立模型调用拓扑。只冻结能力要求：Semantic output 必须经过明确的 semantic validation/review；Presentation 必须真实 Render + Observe；渲染结果必须经过 visual review；Revision 后必须重新验证受影响的结果；Controller 控制 bounded revision 与终止。Semantic Critic 是否必须是独立模型调用、Critic 与 Reviser 是否拆成两个调用，留给最小纵向实现后的 calibration 与 Architecture Ablation 决定。因此 Revision 后必须复审，但不预先规定复审一定由一个独立 Critic call 完成。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T19:37:59+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-034","topic":"calibration_and_locked_evaluation_structure_without_fixed_scale","value":{"historical_samples":"IMPLEMENTATION_CALIBRATION_ONLY","locked_evaluation_samples":"EXCLUDED_FROM_TUNING_AND_USED_AFTER_FINAL_SPEC_FREEZE","comparison_conditions":["legacy_V1_0","V1_2_no_Revision_ablation","full_V1_2"],"repeated_runs_per_condition":true,"all_results_in_denominator":true,"best_result_selection":false,"selective_rerun":false,"formal_eval_prompt_or_parameter_change":false,"evaluation_dimensions":["hard_failures","worst_case","unacceptable_run_rate","cross_run_variance","human_quality"],"locked_sample_count":"FROZEN_AFTER_CALIBRATION","repeat_count_per_condition":"FROZEN_AFTER_CALIBRATION","sizing_inputs":["per_run_cost","observed_variance","human_evaluation_burden"],"fixed_27_run_matrix_in_design_baseline":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-9-q27","captured_text":"Q27 原则按推荐，但不在 Design Baseline 中锁死 `3 samples × 3 systems × 3 repeats = 27` 这一具体评估规模。固定以下评估结构：历史样本只用于 implementation calibration；Final Spec 冻结后使用未参与调参的 locked evaluation samples；对比 legacy V1.0、V1.2 no-Revision ablation 和 full V1.2；每个条件执行重复运行；所有结果进入分母，不挑最好结果、不选择性重跑、不在正式评估过程中修改 Prompt 或参数；同时看 hard failures、worst-case、不可接受运行比例、跨运行方差和人工质量评价。最终的 locked sample 数量与每个条件的 repeat 次数，在 calibration 后根据单次运行成本、方差和人工评估负担冻结。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T19:37:59+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-035","topic":"one_way_semantic_ownership_and_nonsemantic_chrome","value":{"ownership_flow":["Claim_Graph","Editorial_Plan","Presentation_Plan"],"claim_graph_owns":["source_verifiable_propositions","evidence_bindings"],"editorial_plan_is_authority_for":["reader_facing_semantic_content","final_wording","chapter_order","semantic_comparison","semantic_process","semantic_sequence","semantic_grouping"],"presentation_plan_owns":["legal_component_selection","hierarchy","spatial_grouping","emphasis","image_use"],"presentation_plan_may_not_add":["new_semantic_copy","new_conclusion","new_semantic_relationship"],"deterministic_renderer_chrome":["numbering","source_label","step_label"],"renderer_chrome_is_semantic_content":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-10-q28","captured_text":"保持 Claim Graph → Editorial Plan → Presentation Plan 的单向语义所有权。Claim Graph 只负责来源侧可验证命题及 evidence。Editorial Plan 是 reader-facing semantic content 的权威来源，包括最终措辞、章节顺序，以及内容本身要求表达的比较、流程、顺序和分组关系。Presentation Plan 只决定这些已有语义如何通过合法组件、层级、空间分组、强调和图片呈现，不得新增具有报告语义的新文案、结论或关系。Renderer / Design System 仍可确定性生成编号、source label、step label 等非语义 UI chrome。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T21:04:28+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-036","topic":"minimal_claim_graph_and_end_to_end_provenance","value":{"claim_required_fields":["stable_claim_id","atomic_claim_text","claim_kind","canonical_transcript_evidence_unit_ids"],"claim_kind_values":["STATED","SYNTHESIS"],"excluded_fields":["confidence","importance","relationship_taxonomy","external_knowledge"],"deterministically_derived_from_canonical_transcript":["time","source_status","SourceRef"],"required_provenance_chain":["reader_facing_content","Editorial_Content_Unit","Claim","Canonical_Transcript_Unit"]},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-10-q29","captured_text":"Claim Graph 保持最小结构：stable claim_id；atomic claim_text；STATED / SYNTHESIS；Canonical Transcript evidence unit IDs。不增加 confidence、importance、relationship taxonomy 或外部知识字段。时间、来源状态和 SourceRef 从 Canonical Transcript 确定性派生。实质性的 Editorial Content 应可追溯至 Claim，最终 provenance chain 为：reader-facing content → Editorial Content Unit → Claim → Canonical Transcript Unit。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T21:04:28+08:00"}}
{"decision_id":"DEC-VR12-037","topic":"minimal_semantic_revision_and_downstream_regeneration","value":{"semantic_revision_may":["modify_existing_Claim","modify_existing_Editorial_Content","add_previously_omitted_source_supported_content"],"new_content_requires":"EXPLICIT_CANONICAL_TRANSCRIPT_EVIDENCE_BINDING","ungrounded_addition":false,"successful_semantic_revision_invalidates":["Presentation_Plan","Render","Browser_Observation","visual_review"],"required_downstream_action":"REGENERATE_ALL_INVALIDATED_ARTIFACTS","stable_id_allocation":"IMPLEMENTATION_AND_CALIBRATION_DECISION","id_retention_after_change":"IMPLEMENTATION_AND_CALIBRATION_DECISION","authorized_scope_diff_method":"IMPLEMENTATION_AND_CALIBRATION_DECISION","complex_semantic_diff_framework_in_design_baseline":false,"complex_invalidation_framework_in_design_baseline":false},"decision_state":"USER_CONFIRMED","overrides_fields":["DEC-VR12-028.semantic_revision_targets_required","DEC-VR12-028.semantic_scope_guard"],"evidence":{"source_type":"USER_MESSAGE","source_ref":"conversation-2026-09-04-grill-round-10-q30","captured_text":"只冻结以下能力要求：1. Semantic Revision 可以修改已有 Claim / Editorial Content，也可以补充此前遗漏的内容。2. 新增内容必须明确绑定支持它的 Canonical Transcript evidence，不允许无来源补写。3. Semantic Revision 生效后，依赖该语义结果的下游 Presentation、Render、Observation 和 visual review 全部重新生成。稳定 ID 如何分配、修改后哪些 ID 保留、deterministic diff 如何判断授权范围，留给最小纵向实现和 calibration 决定；当前不提前构建复杂 semantic diff / invalidation framework。","captured_at":"2026-09-04T21:04:28+08:00"}}
